<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 7	Feb 6	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  260.860     259.120     247.020    5.60 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.950     304.950     306.830   -0.61 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.880     156.970     158.970   -1.31 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.500	46.518	47.182   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  425.700     425.120     419.180    1.56 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.715     139.755     141.685   -1.39 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.966	15.979	16.185   -1.35 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  210.100     209.630     212.430   -1.10 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.854	 1.858	 1.888   -1.80 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.561	 1.566	 1.581   -1.27 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.585     181.970     183.135   -0.85 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
